  {
    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Deploy a new synthetic asset under the partner's namespace.\\nThe asset will be registered on the SyntheticEngine with\\nthe partner as the deployer.\\n\\nSymbol naming rule: must start with \"P\" to distinguish\\npartner assets from core protocol assets.\\nExamples: \"PSGOLD\" (partner synth gold), \"PSTSLA\"\\n\\n# Arguments\\n* `partner_owner`   \\xe2\\x80\\x94 must be the partner's registered owner wallet\\n* `symbol`          \\xe2\\x80\\x94 unique synth symbol (max 9 chars, starts with \"P\")\\n* `token`           \\xe2\\x80\\x94 pre-deployed SEP-41 contract address\\n* `oracle_symbol`   \\xe2\\x80\\x94 price feed symbol (e.g. \"GOLDUSD\")\\n* `min_cr`          \\xe2\\x80\\x94 minimum collateral ratio in bps (e.g. 15_000 = 150%)\\n* `liq_cr`          \\xe2\\x80\\x94 liquidation CR in bps\\n* `liq_penalty`     \\xe2\\x80\\x94 liquidation bonus in bps\\n* `stab_fee_bps`    \\xe2\\x80\\x94 annual stability fee in bps\\n* `debt_ceiling`    \\xe2\\x80\\x94 max outstanding synth (7dp); cannot exceed global limit",
      "name": "register_partner_asset",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "partner_owner",
          "type_": "address"
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "symbol",
          "type_": "symbol"
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "token",
          "type_": "address"
        },
